Z||000002||ToddAsh||02-13-2001||07:41 PM||||About a year ago I got a sample of Dri-Wash.I laughed because it was at Corvettes at Carlisle and I couldn't beleive anyone would use this on a Vette. Anyway I tried it on my truck and was blown away. It's awsome.I use it on everything I own and people constantly ask me how my cars get a mirror finish.Have 6 cars ,all look better than new. Sound like I'm selling it but I'm not.Makes everything look great. Paint, glass,black trim,interior,I even spray it under the hood.Just try a sample,you'll throw away everything else you have. Todd||||reg||1
